WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.757 --> 00:00:03.400
- [Voiceover] This is Charlotte,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.900
a prehensile-tailed porcupine.

00:00:07.461 --> 00:00:09.266
With her short, thick spines,

00:00:09.266 --> 00:00:13.366
she's adorably speckled,
but that cute little outfit

00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:17.287
is actually an excellent
defense mechanism.

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:19.484
Her spines rise up when threatened

00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:23.586
to give a larger and more
threatening appearance.

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:26.162
Charlotte will spend most
of her life in the trees

00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:29.960
deep in the forests of
Central and South America.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.226
She feeds on bark,
leaves, fruits and roots.

00:00:34.226 --> 00:00:36.466
Her feet have long, curved claws,

00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:39.584
making her an adept climber.

00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:41.986
While prehensile-tailed porcupines

00:00:41.986 --> 00:00:44.802
are formidable at protecting themselves,

00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:47.463
they are less successful against humans

00:00:47.463 --> 00:00:51.906
as they are hunted for food
in parts of their habitat.

00:00:51.906 --> 00:00:54.402
That along with a diminishing territory

00:00:54.402 --> 00:00:57.319
have left their population in flux.

00:00:58.444 --> 00:01:01.777
This is the prehensile-tailed porcupine.

